From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: McKack <4465550+McKack@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 20:22:33 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] d3d12: keep converted shaders in the disk shader cache

D3D12 pipelines converted every shader with airconv each time a game started. The conversions now go through DXMT's disk shader cache, as D3D11's do, keyed by the shader bytecode(s), the entry point and every compile argument; Metal already caches its own compile of the result.
